234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (1. Inpainting  The key mechanism is the application of a binary mask within the loss function, which restricts the optimization to only the known, undamaged pixels.  Due to the inductive bias of the CNN structure, the network automatically propagates valid textures from the surroundings into the masked gaps.)
/E (1. Inpainting  The key mechanism is the application of a binary mask within the loss function, which restricts the optimization to only the known, undamaged pixels.  Due to the inductive bias of the CNN structure, the network automatically propagates valid textures from the surroundings into the masked gaps.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
