<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (2. Super resolution The optimization process involves a differentiable downsampling operator.  In each iteration, the network's high-resolution output is downsampled to match the dimensions of the original low-resolution input.  Among possible high-resolution images , the CNN structure onverges to the one with the most reasonable natural details and sharp edges.)
/E (2. Super resolution The optimization process involves a differentiable downsampling operator.  In each iteration, the network's high-resolution output is downsampled to match the dimensions of the original low-resolution input.  Among possible high-resolution images , the CNN structure onverges to the one with the most reasonable natural details and sharp edges.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
